text And...
text This is when I get to be alone with Kotomi.
text Our shoulders occasionally touch as we walk down the city streets.
text I look at Kotomi next to me.
text She turns to me as if she has something to say.
setvar strS[1001] = "CGKT13B"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
setimg CGKT13B.png
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
sound DRX.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text Tomoya-kun, um...
text @[Tomoya]
text What?
sound DRY.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text If you'd like, that is...
setvar strS[1001] = "CGKT16B"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
setimg CGKT16B.png
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
sound DRZ.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text Can we hold hands?
text I hold out my hand in answer.
setvar strS[1001] = "CGKT16A"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
setimg CGKT16A.png
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
text *Grip*
text Our palms touch and I can feel her warmth.
text I gently strengthen my grip, as if to envelop her slender fingers.
text There are so many things I should be saying right now.
text The things that gentleman said...
text It feels like there are multiple knots in my stomach that I can't unravel.
text There's also the fact that I like Kotomi.
text But because I don't want to ruin our time together...
text I keep quiet as we walk along.
setvar strS[1000] = "KURO"
setvar intA[1000] = 1
if intA[1000] == 0
	goto s13
fi
goto 14
